{"id":"wb-5-161","name":"浙南石棚墓群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"浙南石棚墓群","text":"浙南石棚墓群是浙江省温州市下属的瑞安市、平阳县、苍南县境内的全国重点文物保护单位。\n石棚是世界文明史上巨石文化遗产的重要组成部分。在中国境内主要分布在东北的辽宁省和吉林省。中国南方仅浙南沿海地区有分布，浙江省温州市和台州市境内共有五十六座石棚墓。\n2001年，温州市境内的浙南石棚墓，以浙南石棚墓群之名被中国国务院列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B5%99%E5%8D%97%E7%9F%B3%E6%A3%9A%E5%A2%93%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":93331368,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93331368","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d7919a5ca5a7a3ae46360259.jpg","title":"Ruian_Qipanshan_Shipengmu.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ruian_Qipanshan_Shipengmu.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f2/Ruian_Qipanshan_Shipengmu.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"司图博行","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​棋盘山石棚墓，是全国重点文物保护单位浙南石棚墓群的一部分","width":320,"height":214}}